    <title>Jim Nantz on &quot;Hello Friends,&quot; calling the Masters and an all-time Arnold Palmer story</title>
    <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ss4uwGftlVI</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ss4uwGftlVI</guid>
