    <dc:creator>Skratch</dc:creator>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;In this special Masters edition of the Vanity Index Podcast, legendary sports broadcaster Jim Nantz joins to talk all things Augusta. He shares the touching origin story of his &quot;Hello Friends&quot; welcome, what it was like to call Tiger&#x27;s 2019 comeback and Rory&#x27;s 2025 Grand Slam moment, getting emotional in the booth, and an epic dinner with Arnold Palmer and the Queen of England.

Catch the Vanity Index Podcast on Golf Channel every Wednesday at 10am ET, or listen anytime on Spotify and Apple.

